<title>DENMARK: Moeller buys Chinese tankers.</title>
<headline>Moeller buys Chinese tankers.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Danish oil and shipping group A.P. Moeller said on Monday that it had ordered three tankers at an undisclosed sum from China's Guangzhou Shipyard International Co.</p>
</text>
